#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:5
#: 225229fb776f45118f166bbf30a3fa91
msgid "Analog Current Monitor Calibration"
msgstr "模拟电流监测器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:7
#: c57c0b0bae3a472f9fa9ff16eaeb7c60
msgid ""
"Analog current monitors usually consist of an ultralow resistance shunt used"
" to generate a very small voltage which is then electronically amplified and"
" delivered to the autopilot via one of its analog-to-digital (A/D) "
"interfaces. In ArduPilot, this voltage is scaled by the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` parameter to "
"indicated the current level. The "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` parameter is "
"provided to correct for any voltage offsets generated by the current "
"monitor's amplifier that results in output when zero current is flowing thru"
" the shunt."
msgstr ""
"模拟电流监测器通常由超低阻值分流电阻组成，用于产生极小电压，经电子放大后通过飞控的模数转换（A/D）接口输入。在 ArduPilot 中，该电压由 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"参数进行缩放，以指示电流值。:ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`"
" 参数用于修正电流监测放大器产生的电压偏置，该偏置会在零电流流过分流时导致输出误差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:12
#: 985463496e1c4b86a65a3400a1fe26a7
msgid ""
"This monitor's accuracy  and repeatability across different boards is "
"dependent on many factors: - The tolerance of the shunt resistor and "
"amplifier components - The quality of the PCB layout which can induce "
"parasitic errors due to high current flows - The temperature coefficient of "
"the components since high currents can cause localized heating in some "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"该监测器的精度和一致性受多种因素影响：- 分流电阻和放大器元器件的公差 - PCB 布局质量（大电流流动产生的寄生误差） - "
"元器件的温度系数（大电流有时会引起局部发热）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:17
#: c97f78b722aa46a9bb71f2ee81d1d061
msgid ""
"many of these issues do not occur if using a HALL-EFFECT current sensor "
"instead of a resistive shunt. Unfortunately, those are more bulky and "
"expensive and are not practical for use on autopilots with integrated "
"current sensors."
msgstr ""
"如果使用霍尔效应电流传感器而非电阻分流，上述许多问题将不会出现。遗憾的是，霍尔效应传感器体积更大、成本更高，对于集成了电流传感器的飞控并不实用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:19
#: 8548a6baccb6446fa1744e9c4e69f0dd
msgid ""
"The net result is that shunt current sensors usually need their ArduPilot "
"parameters tweaked to achieve good results. There are two main methods for "
"calibration: #. Using a good ammeter. Hobby grade devices such as the `GT "
"Power Meter <https://www.amazon.com/GT-Power-Analyzer-Consumption-"
"Performance/dp/B00C1BZSYO>`__ or inexpensive `DVM types "
"<https://www.amazon.com/GT-Power-Analyzer-Consumption-"
"Performance/dp/B00C1BZSYO>`__ can be used to set the scale and offset. #. "
"Empirically, by test flying and comparing the used mah reported for the "
"flight vs how much charge is put back into the battery during recharge."
msgstr ""
"综上所述，分流电流传感器通常需要调整 ArduPilot 参数才能获得良好效果。主要有两种校准方法：1. 使用精度良好的电流表。可使用 `GT "
"Power Meter <https://www.amazon.com/GT-Power-Analyzer-Consumption-"
"Performance/dp/B00C1BZSYO>`__ 等爱好者级设备或廉价 `数字万用表 <https://www.amazon.com/GT-"
"Power-Analyzer-Consumption-Performance/dp/B00C1BZSYO>`__ 来设定缩放和偏置。2. "
"实飞验证：对比飞行后上报的已用电量（mAh）与充电时回充的实际电量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:24
#: 1fc5d03985f24c9abe513b141dac66cb
msgid "Using an Ammeter"
msgstr "使用电流表"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:25
#: 5598ced84a234246b05d81d296e71247
msgid ""
"Attach the ammeter and power the vehicle with its battery. Connect to the "
"GCS and note the current reported."
msgstr "连接电流表，用电池为飞行器上电。连接地面站，记录上报的电流值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:26
#: 94411f77476a4c4a80bbacefba54b43d
msgid ""
"Adjust the :ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"parameter to match the ammeter."
msgstr ""
"调整 :ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"参数以匹配电流表读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:27
#: a2a75945805a4e7aa0913dc6f166f42f
msgid ""
"Arm and throttle up the vehicle. For Copters this can be done with the "
"propellers reversed to hold the vehicle down. For Plane, it should be "
"secured (A helper is advised) to prevent movement. Rover will need some way "
"to load the wheels."
msgstr ""
"解锁并推高油门。对于 Copter，可以将螺旋桨反向安装以将飞机固定在地面。对于 Plane，应将其固定好（建议由助手协助）以防止移动。Rover "
"需要某种方式对车轮施加负载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:29
#: 0ac4fb6ce0b44c3bbaed6dbbe0bff6a4
msgid ""
"be safe! make sure you or someone else cannot be injured while doing this!"
msgstr "注意安全！确保您或他人在操作过程中不会受到伤害！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:31
#: a6c914fd6aab448db222602b441b1ebb
msgid ""
"The throttle level should stimulate current consumption close to the "
"expected normal vehicle flight condition (ie like cruising level in Plane or"
" hovering in Copter)."
msgstr "油门水平应使电流消耗接近预期正常飞行状态（即 Plane 的巡航状态或 Copter 的悬停状态）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:32
#: ed65405b5cd545fb8a0aec6076a83968
msgid ""
"Note the difference betweeen the ammeter and what the GCS reports and adjust"
" the :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` to "
"match."
msgstr ""
"记录电流表与 GCS 报告值之间的差异，并调整 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 使两者匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:33
#: 9216e4fbb3e54a13b86552f9049bafd9
msgid ""
"Recheck the idle current and re-adjust the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`, if needed. "
"There will be some interaction between it and the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` so some "
"repetition of the above may be needed."
msgstr ""
"重新检查静息电流，如有必要，重新调整 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`。它与 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"之间存在相互影响，因此可能需要重复上述步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:35
#: 4bd047db7aea4dc7a5df9b7f4836a074
msgid ""
"Its always good to use the process explained next to tweak the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` parameter "
"after a real flight or two."
msgstr ""
"建议在实际飞行一两次后，按以下说明的流程微调 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:38
#: 2d4e8055460448919cd64d80f75b606f
msgid "Empirical Adjustment"
msgstr "经验调整法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:39
#: 01c0a6cd585a424fa51f6c42c0eb644a
msgid ""
"Power the vehicle on the bench with its battery and note the reported "
"current to the GCS. As a guess, normally it should read in the .2 to .4A "
"range with the autopilot and peripherals powered. If a VTX is also in the "
"system, it could be in the .6A range. Adjust "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` to get that "
"reported value."
msgstr ""
"在桌面上用电池为飞机上电，记录 GCS 报告的电流。通常情况下，飞控和外设上电后应读数在 0.2 至 0.4A "
"范围内。如果系统中还有图传（VTX），可能在 0.6A 左右。调整 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 以获得该报告值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:40
#: 33b1b8120b8c462580efadd123f1ec79
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Test fly with a lengthy period in its normal flying condition (ie one "
"takeoff, one landing only). Try to use at least 50% of the battery."
msgstr "在正常飞行条件下进行较长时间的试飞（即一次起飞、一次降落）。尽量使用至少 50% 的电池电量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:41
#: 819a38bc925f4fb3a65e79abcaeec909
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"From the flight log determine how much battery was consumed, re-charge it "
"and note how much was put back. This is usually about 105% of what was "
"consumed. Adjust the "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` param "
"according to this:"
msgstr ""
"从飞行日志中确定消耗的电量，对电池充电并记录充入的电量。充入量通常约为消耗量的 105%。按以下公式调整 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:43
#: 6e37061b8c12482284bdff4df93288fe
msgid ""
"(amount of charge put back into battery/ reported used charge ) * current "
"value becomes the new value for "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`"
msgstr ""
"（充入电池的电量 / 报告消耗的电量）× 当前值 = "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 的新值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:44
#: cf8ae15d74ee43888f92d71b7a975a58
msgid ""
"Readjust the :ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"value on the bench"
msgstr ""
"在桌面重新调整 :ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET<BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-current-calibration.rst:45
#: 67b479d8b5b44b199ee23f3e08904d23
msgid "Test fly again, iterate as needed."
msgstr "再次试飞，根据需要反复迭代。"
